This project predicts whether a patient is Diabetic or Not Diabetic using the Pima Indians Diabetes Dataset. 
The resualbe functions used in this project are :
load_data()
clean_data()
split_data()
train_model()
predict()
save_model()
Using LogisticRegression , KNN , Decision Tree models the best model is saved and used to predict whether the patient is Diabetic or Not.
